# Ovie project rules

Before implementing features, read the relevant doc in `.cursor/docs/`:

- Scraping → `scraping.md`
- Database → `database-schema.md`
- Chat/retrieval → `retrieval-chat.md`
- Frontend pages → `page-structure.md`
- API → `api.md`
- Admin → `admin.md`

## Domain conventions

- MVP suppliers: `henry-schein`, `adam-dental`
- One scraper adapter per supplier in `backend/src/scrapers/{slug}/`
- LLM uses typed tools only — no raw SQL, no arbitrary URLs
- Hybrid retrieval: structured + FTS + vector (not vector-only)
- Playwright runs in workers only, not API handlers
- Answers must be grounded in `supplier_products` with timestamps
